 5625|  20.3k|        // the pair is itself a fusable condition: the negation of the first.
 5626|  20.3k|        // It is recorded with that instruction's start position, so a branch
 5627|  20.3k|        // consuming this `i32.eqz` rewinds both away and emits a single fused
 5628|  20.3k|        // branch of the opposite polarity. Nothing is lost when no branch
 5629|  20.3k|        // follows: the `i32.eqz` below is still emitted and still materializes
 5630|  20.3k|        // the boolean.
 5631|  20.3k|        let fusable: (condition: FusableCondition, result: VReg, start: MetaProgramCounter?)
